  ('IE:graphic-designer','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,6,5,19,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 3421 Graphic designers.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 Arts, Sports & Tourism reports below-average group growth and does not publish an exact Graphic Designer shortage; 0/20.','visa_basis','Generic Graphic Designer is not itself named on the current Critical Skills list. Specific 3421 animation design roles are CSEP-eligible, but that specialist treatment is not borrowed by generic graphic design. SOC 3421 was not found on the current Ineligible list, so ordinary GEP access may apply; 6/10.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Portfolio plus relevant design education or equivalent applied experience is a common entry pattern; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:ux-designer','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,10,5,23,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 2137 Web design and development professionals, constrained to digital UX/interface design duties.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 ICT identifies software developers/engineers and IT analysts/engineers as shortages, not UX designers specifically; 0/20.','visa_basis','SOC 2137 Web design and development professionals is explicitly on the current Critical Skills Occupations List; 10/10.','scope_boundary','The score applies where the actual duties fit SOC 2137 digital/web UX design; broader user research or service-design jobs may classify differently.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Portfolio plus UX/product/design education or equivalent experience is a common route; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:multimedia-designer','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,8,5,21,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Cross-SOC canonical profile spanning SOC 3421 visual/multimedia design and SOC 2137 web/digital design where duties fit. No single primary code is forced.','shortage_note','No exact Multimedia Designer shortage is published in the reviewed SOLAS 2025 Arts or ICT summaries; 0/20.','visa_basis','SOC 2137 duties can qualify for CSEP, while generic SOC 3421 design is generally GEP-accessible unless the job matches one of the listed animation CSEP specialisms. Conditional mixed-scope credit 8/10.','scope_boundary','A multimedia title alone is not sufficient to claim SOC 2137 or animation-specialist CSEP treatment; actual duties control classification.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Portfolio plus multimedia/digital design education or applied experience is a common route; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:animator','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,8,5,21,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 3411 Artists as the primary animation-artist scope, with related SOC 3421 animation-design specialisms retained separately.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 Arts, Sports & Tourism does not publish an occupation-wide Animator shortage; 0/20.','visa_basis','The current Critical Skills list names specific 2D/3D animation roles under SOC 3411 and 3421, generally with at least one year of role experience. Generic Animator is broader than those named employments, so conditional CSEP credit 8/10 is used rather than universal 10/10.','scope_boundary','Art Director 2473 and Games Rigger 3417 are separate occupations and are not rolled into the generic Animator profile.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Animation portfolio/reel plus relevant training, degree or production experience is a common entry pattern; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:interior-designer','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,6,5,19,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 3422 Product, clothing and related designers, constrained to interior-design work.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 Arts, Sports & Tourism does not publish an exact Interior Designer shortage; 0/20.','visa_basis','The canonical Interior Designer scope is neither explicitly Critical Skills nor identified on the current Ineligible list; ordinary GEP access may apply subject to permit conditions; 6/10.','scope_boundary','Interior Designer is not promoted to Architect SOC 2431 and does not borrow architect CSEP or statutory registration treatment.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Portfolio plus interior/spatial design education or equivalent experience is a common route; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement for the Interior Designer title; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:film-editor','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,6,5,19,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 3416 Arts officers, producers and directors, constrained to film/video post-production editor duties.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 Arts, Sports & Tourism does not publish an exact Film Editor shortage; 0/20.','visa_basis','SOC 3416 is not explicitly on the current Critical Skills list and was not identified on the current Ineligible list; ordinary GEP access may apply subject to conditions; 6/10.','scope_boundary','Camera, audio-visual equipment and broadcasting-operator roles in SOC 3417 are not substituted for the editor scope.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Editing reel/portfolio plus film, broadcasting or digital-media education and production experience is a common route; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:architect','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,10,1,15,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 2431 Architects and town planners, exact Architect employment.','shortage_note','Architect is on the current Critical Skills list, but SOLAS 2025 Construction does not publish Architect in its explicit shortage list; shortage and permit evidence are kept separate, so 0/20.','visa_basis','Architect is explicitly listed under SOC 2431 on the current Critical Skills Occupations List; 10/10.','registration_basis','The Building Control Act 2007 protects the title Architect in Ireland; only persons on the statutory Register of Architects may use it.','entry_basis','RIAI describes the typical Irish route as a prescribed five-year architecture qualification plus at least two years of approved postgraduate professional training and a Professional Practice Examination; 4/15.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_burden_basis','Protected title and lengthy statutory registration pathway create high entry burden; 1/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
  ('IE:web-designer','2026-08-11',null,null,null,0,0,0,0,8,0,0,10,5,23,'career-opportunity-ie-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 2010 2137 Web design and development professionals, web-designer scope.','shortage_note','SOLAS 2025 ICT shows strong sector demand but names software developers/engineers and IT analysts/engineers as shortages, not web designers specifically; 0/20.','visa_basis','SOC 2137 Web design and development professionals is explicitly on the current Critical Skills Occupations List; 10/10.','salary_method','No exact comparable current Irish occupation-level median salary series has been normalised; 0.','entry_basis','Portfolio plus web/design training or related higher education and practical front-end/design experience is a common route; 8/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal registration requirement; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11')
